      "en": "“Surely I would speak to the Almighty. I desire to reason with God.",
      "ko": "참으로 나는 전능자에게 말씀하려 하며 하나님과 변론하려 하노라",
      "source_text_hash": "bead82a68eac85e7008b1ba48d0801f1dc44b11fd33c5785c30e2764c165ef52",
      "translation_text_hash": "3e169f8998bacfabf6f06b4d9ab8556b9ea8ddce53476f80855aaa018f83e8a7",
