      "en": "Oh that you would be completely silent! Then you would be wise.",
      "ko": "너희가 잠잠하고 잠잠하기를 원하노라 이것이 너희의 지혜일 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "9c4010b8b5270aca0e5cc11eaa246024484b0ea1bb113143c5593715abc5300f",
      "translation_text_hash": "4ff155bb03ed95603308c542847167d96a5e6df5cba81c851708272a7bbc5e4e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
